Underlying source
-----------------

The verbal content of the dataset is derived from publicly available
verbatim transcripts of Dewan Rakyat (Malaysian Parliament) proceedings,
published at https://www.parlimen.gov.my. English text is produced by
machine translation of the original Malay transcripts.


